### Demo-only secrets & generated certs/keystores ###
# Self-signed dev TLS certs (key+cert+bundle, regenerated together) and
# Java keystores - all regenerable per-environment, never meant to be
# shared between machines. Never committed even though a working demo
# needs them to exist locally - see the top-level demo repo's README for
# how they get (re)generated on first run.
docker-compose/haproxy/certs/*
docker-compose/keycloak/certs/*
docker-compose/status-list/certs/*
docker-compose/pid-issuer/issuer-keys.jks
src/main/resources/issuer-keys.jks
!docker-compose/haproxy/certs/.gitkeep
!docker-compose/keycloak/certs/.gitkeep
!docker-compose/status-list/certs/.gitkeep
